      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya batooleke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū ū mu mihayo īyo ng'wanandīkīlile, īlī hambū hambū ū munhū atizūtoola nūūlū kūtoolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo kūlwa nguno ya kogoha būjingi, būlī ngosha ni abizage na nke wakwe ng'wenekīlī, na a bakīma gīko; nabo būlī ng'wene abize na ngoshi wakwe ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ang'wītīle ū nke gīt'ūmo shiigelile; nū nkīma ang'wītīle chene ū ngoshi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma atī na būsugi ū kū mīlī gokwe, alīyo ngoshi; nū ngosha atī na būsugi ū kū mīlī gokwe, alīyo nke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwilemeja, numho ūlū mu kwizunīlīja makanza malebe dūhū, gīkī mupandīke ng'wanya gwa kūlomba mu būlembeezu; alīyo ishokelagi hangī, ū Shetani atizūmugema kūlwa kūlemeelwa kwilang'hana kwing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyū nalīgūhaya mu būganikīji, ītī gītī shilagīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahene ni nayega a banhū pye a bose ūlū ni babiza gīt'ūmo nalī ū nene; gwike būlī munhū alī na kinhīlwe kakwe wei ng'wenekīlī kūfuma kūlī Mulungu; ūyū kinhīlwe aka, nū yūyo kinhīlwe ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū kū banhū abo batī batooleke na a bachīlwa, a bene īkūbeelela ūlū būbiza gīt'ūmo nalī ū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū būlemeelwa ū kwilang'hana, ni batoolage nūūlū kūtoolwa, nguno īlī chiza ū kūtoola nūūlū kūtoolwa, kūtinda kūminyiwa makoye ga kwikūmva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a batooleke nalībahūgūla, nīyo natī nene, alīyo Seeba; gīkī ū nkīma atizūlekana nū ngoshi okwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūlekana nang'hwe ikale atatoolilwe, nūūlū bishokele nū ngoshi; nū ngosha atizūneka ū nke okwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū kū bangī nalīhaya nene, atī Seeba; ūlū ndūgū alī na nke atī nzunya, alīyo ū nke ng'wenūyo atogilwe ū kwikala nang'hwe, atizūneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nkīma ūlū alī na ngoshi atī nzunya, alīyo atogilwe ū kwikala nang'hwe, atizūneka ū ngoshi ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū ngosha ūlū atī nzunya akeejiagwa kūlwa nke, nū nkīma ūyo atī nzunya akeejiagwa kūlwa ngoshi ūyo alī ndūgū; ūlū ītī chene numho a baana bing'we ni batī beela, alīyo ī haha balī beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūyo atī nzunya ūlū wīnga ni ajage; ū mu mihayo gītī yenīyo ū ndūgū ū ngosha nūūlū ū nkīma atatungilwe, alīyo ū Mulungu atwitanile kūlwa kikalīle ka mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū bebe nkīma ūmanile kinehe, hamo ūdūgije kūmpīja ū ngoshi wako; nū bebe ngosha ūmanile kinehe, hamo ūdūgije kūmpīja ū nke wako?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banhū ba ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, būlī ng'wene shiigelile ashimīze gīt'ūmo agabīlilwe na Seeba, ūmo Mulungu ang'witanīlile. H'ūmo nakūlangīlaga ū mu kanisa pyī ī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīho ose ose ūyo walī asaalilwe aho alitanwa? Atizitūūla mu būtūsaalwa; alīho ose ose ūyo walī atasaalilwe aho alitanwa? Nang'hwe atizūsaalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būsaalwa būtī na solobo, nū būtūsaalwa būtī na solobo; ū mhayo ntaale gūlī kūdima shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ni ikalage ūmo walī aho alitanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo olī nsese aho ūlitanwa? Gūtizūkūkoya ū gwenūyo; gwike ūlū ūlī na būdūla bo kūfuma ū mu būsese, īlī yawiza wīnge mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūyo witanwa kūbiza mulī Seeba ūsangwa alī mu būsese, ū ng'wenūyo ntungūlwa ū mulī Seeba; nū yūyo witanwa ūsangwa alī mu wiyabī nang'hwe nsese wa ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mugūlilwe na mpango ntaale, hūna lūūlū yaya ū kūbiza basese ba banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū bane, būlī ng'wene ni ikalage hamò na Mulungu ū mu kikalīle ako witanīlwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būganikīji mu mihayo ya witooji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū banhya, natī na būhūgūji kwīngīīla kūlī Seeba, alīyo nalīng'winha būganikīji bone, nguno ū Seeba akanichīla shigongo ūnibona gīkī nashikile kūsanyiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū kūlwa nguno ya wilwisha ūbo būlīho ī shikū jenīji, ū nene nalībona īlī yawiza ū munhū ikale gīt'ūmo alī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo ūtoolile? Yaya ū kūkooba kūbūlaga kaya; hamo wamala kūlekana na nkīma? Yaya ū kūkooba ūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ahene nūūlū ūtoola hangī, ūtūbiza wīta gwabūbi. Pyī nū munhya ūlū ūtoolwa atūbiza wahūba; alīyo ī chene ū nene natogilwe kūmupīja mutizingīla mu makoye ga mīlī, ayo gakabakoyaga batooleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo nalīgūhaya badūgū bane gūlī gīkī, ī haha ī likanza lyagubbīng'haga; īlo lyasaagaga ho abo batoolile ni babizage gītī batatoolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakūlīlaga babize gītī batūlīlaga, na a babo balī mu būyegi babize gītī batī mu būyegi, na a babo bakūgūlaga babize gītī batī na shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a babo bakūshitūmamīlaga ī sha mu sī, nabo baleke ū kūshitūmamīla būyaga būyaga; nguno ī mihayo ya mu sī īlībīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, a bing'we natatogilwe mubize ba kwikala ng'ūkoya koya, nguno ūyo atatoolile akateeganaga na mihayo ya ng'wa Seeba, akakoobaga ūmo alanyegeje ū Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ūyo atoolile ū ng'wene akateeganaga na ya mu sī, akakoobaga ūmo alanyegeje ū nke; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nose hū kūhaya ū ng'wenūyo agabanīkile. Nū nkīma ūyo atatoolilwe, pyī nū munhya; nang'hwe akateeganīlaga ya ng'wa Seeba, gīkī abize ng'wela ū mu mīlī nū mu moyo. Alīyo ū nkīma ūyo atoolilwe, ū ng'wene akateeganaga kūlwa mihayo ya mu sī, ūmo alanyegeje ū ngoshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwenūyū nalīmuwīla kūlwa solobo ying'we, natūmuwīlaga gīkī namuchaamīkīle ishikī lya kūmuhangīja, muleke kūsunang'hīla kūja kū būtongi; alīyo natogilwe mubize na kashimīzīle kasoga, muntūmamīle ū Seeba mutī na sha kūng'wipamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū munhū imanile na munhya nebe hūna ūbona gīkī alīheewa na kwikūmva kūlwa nguno yakwe, hama ū munhya ng'wenūyo alījīlīīla mu nyakūlīji, ū munhū ng'wenūyo ni abītīlage mu nzīla īyo īzunīlīgije, agwīte ūyo atogilwe kūgwīta; akūbiza atūhūbaga, ni bitoolage dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wa kūtimbyang'holò ūhandatīla mu būtūhadīkījiwa, ūsola wei ng'wenekīlī mung'holò yakwe gwa kūleka kūntoola ū munhya ng'wenūyo, hama ūbiza na būdūla bo kūgasuga a maganiko gakwe, akūbiza alīīta gwawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya gīkī ūyo alantoole ū munhya akūtūngīlīja, alīyo ū wa kūleka, ū ng'wene akūbiza wīta gwawiza kūtinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma atungilwe kūlī ngoshi pyī ī likanza aho ngoshi ataalī mpanga, alīyo ūlū ūcha ū ngoshi akūbiza watungūlīlagwa, ni atoolagwe na munhū ose ose ūyo alantogwe; gwike mulī Seeba dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu kūbona kwane nalībona gīkī, ūlū wikala gīko akūbiza na būyegi kūtinda, ū nene nalībona gīkī, nane nalī nang'hwe ū Moyo wa ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.7.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
